<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - KRASNAPOLSKY H1 NET PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - KRASNAPOLSKY H1 NET PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     3.7  vs   2.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				39.0  vs  35.0</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     9.0  vs   7.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Hotel and restaurant group Krasnapolsky NV previously</p>
<p>said it expected a major profit rise in 1997.</p>
<p>In today's statement, the company said it expected the 1997</p>
<p>second-half net profit would also show a substantial increase</p>
<p>compared with the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
